is super poor because her home is on the verge of the collapse. Miyaka lives with her younger siblings and has to take care of them; in order to do so, she works at a maid cafe. She became one of the wife candidates out of her own will because she believes she could be able to save her family through her decision."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27198"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本有数の名家『三条院家』の娘だが、実家が崩落寸前なため、超貧乏。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家を建て直すために昼夜問わず働く両親の代わりに、幼い弟妹の世話を見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、家計を助けるため、自らもメイド喫茶で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と結婚してお家復興の資金・弟妹の学費を得ようと、『三条院』のネームバリューを使い許嫁クラスに進んで入った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貧乏なので、いつもお腹をすかせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイト先ではいつも残った食材を持ち帰っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6244","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本有数の名家・三条院家の娘だが、実家が崩落寸前なため超貧乏。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家を建て直すため働き詰めの両親に代わり、幼い弟妹の面倒を見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして家計を助けるため自らもメイド喫茶で働き、いつも残った食材を持ち帰っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貧乏なので、いつもお腹を空かせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信士と結婚してお家復興の資金＆弟妹の学費を得るため、三条院のネームバリューを使って自ら許嫁クラスに入った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あの三条院家の娘ってわけ。 アンタ、ちゃんと意味わかってる？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47526"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/4176d9a52155aeb90d69649b684c9c061aaaf6fd8d0662041caa6fbc3ebd315b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/defd14f8c717c6a03762843714b66ce33307c953871d4a405e2d6435ffbe2ac9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47526:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c27200","characterName":"如月 零","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47527","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6245"],"vndbCharacterId":"c27200"},"originalCharacterName":"如月 零","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of a family known for their martial arts. Because of this, she has been trained by her father which has made her very strong and made Rei love moving around. However, she is abysmally terrible and clumsy at cooking. Rei was sent by her mother to become one of the wife candidates because she lacked beauty in the combination of strong and beauty, two conditions needed in order for her to inherit the Kisaragi house."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27200"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"武道家である父親に幼い頃から鍛えられてることもあり、とても強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体を動かすことが大好きだが、手先は不器用で、料理は壊滅的に下手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家が代々続く武道一家であり、零がその跡を継ぐことになっているが、「強さ」と「美しさ」を兼ね備えることが条件。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"零には「美しさ」が足りないと考えた母親が、無理やり許嫁クラスに入れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を女性を囲う不埒者と勘違いし、近寄ろうともせず威嚇する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6245","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々続く武道一家の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"武道家である父親に幼い頃から鍛えられていることもあり、とても強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ身体を動かすことは大好きだが、手先が不器用で特に料理は壊滅的に下手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“強さ” と “美しさ” を兼ね備えることが家を継ぐ条件となっているのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"零には美しさが足りないと考えた母親に、無理やり許嫁クラスに入れられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことを女性を囲う不埒者と勘違いし、近寄ろうともせず威嚇する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私の目が黒い内は、不埒な真似は許さないからな！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47527"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/78c83ecb26f8b633ec808cf0ca1608913fc289543ce64fdd5a2fa12941b19747.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/cefc8d66a1de66e7645aeb19f5aa68fb2e1e5856e969d326b781a0b2351b09c1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西口有香","creatorId":"vndb:s24","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24","name":"西口 有香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47527:6592:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c27201","characterName":"羽川 空","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47528","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6246"],"vndbCharacterId":"c27201"},"originalCharacterName":"羽川 空","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A plain and shy girl who is a member of drama club, but is always outshined by the other members. Kuu became one of the wife candidates after the principal saw how popular she is with the guys due to her gentle appearance and personality. At first Kuu was wary of Shinji because he didn't show any kind of reaction to her performance she put her all into, but ever since then she's trying her best to get a reaction out of him with her acting skills."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27201"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"演劇所属だが、演技が大根なため、他の部員からバカにされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平凡な一般家庭の女の子だが、可愛らしい外見や大人しい性格などから男子学生に人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その人気ぶりが理事長の目にも留まり、許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初は主人公を警戒していたが、零と絡む主人公のリアクションが表現豊かだったため、それを学びたいと考える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以来、主人公にちょっかい（悪戯）を出して、リアクションを引き出している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6246","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"平凡な一般家庭の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"演劇部に所属しているが、演技が下手なので他の部員からバカにされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしい外見やおとなしい性格から男子学生に人気があり、それが理事長の目にも留まって許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初は主人公を警戒していたが、彼のリアクションが表現豊かだったため、それを自身の演技に活かせないかと考え始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それからというもの、主人公にちょっかい （イタズラ） を出してはリアクションを引き出そうする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「アナタのリアクション、面白いです。 リアルガチの称号を授けましょう」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47528"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9f058819c0fc971cf5f1c6cf6db17a1756db50c10194ce92243a1374e4c3b3c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/6588cd3de3b72becd3836095df1a0db6971dc8c6595e3ae3a6ac0aa62b01a1e0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47528:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c27202","characterName":"夏色 ここあ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47529","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6247"],"vndbCharacterId":"c27202"},"originalCharacterName":"夏色 ここあ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only daughter of the ultra-wealthy Natsuiro family. An energetic and optimistic girl who always has a smile on her face, she also loves magical girl anime. Because her servants have done everything for her, she feels dissatisfied with her life. Her parents made her become one of the wife candidates in order increase their assets. However, Kokoa doesn't care about this at all and just enjoys high school and campus life very much."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27202"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超大金持ちの夏色財閥の一人娘。いつもニコニコ笑顔で、常にポワポワしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法少女のアニメが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とここあを結婚させ、家を更に大きくしようと画策した両親により、許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はそのことを知らないまま、陽気に学園生活を楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親は娘可愛さのあまり、小さい頃から使用人の彼女の身の回りの世話を全てさせているが、ここあはその生活に少し不満を持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6247","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超大金持ちの夏色財閥の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもニコニコ笑顔で、常にポワポワしている。　魔法少女のアニメが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から使用人が身の回りの世話をしてくれているが、本人はその生活に少し不満。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と結婚させて家をさらに大きくしようと考えた両親により、許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はそのことを知らないまま、陽気に学園生活を楽しんでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「じゃあ、あなたはレッドね～。 それともブルーがい～い？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47529"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5f51908afdcb5392af0da9514e13b305eba39a878a4e7f09036fb3d3bf8a78c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ed281cd7a692a2dd3b598fc099883ee1bb131c9ebec38dfc120daed257a6813.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朋永真季","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47529:6351:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34110","characterName":"伊東 妙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47530","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6249"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34110"},"originalCharacterName":"伊東 妙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A total chuunibyo girl. Her parents decided to make her one of the wife candidates so they wouldn't have to tolerate Tae's behavior."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34110"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自らを選ばれし人間だと信じる中二病な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かにつけて中二のようなセリフを付け加える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その奇抜な設定が面倒くさく、周囲から敬遠されがちである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と結婚すれば、娘の面倒をみなくても良いと喜んだ両親に、許嫁クラスに入れられた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6249","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自らを選ばれし人間だと信じる中二病な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かにつけて中二のようなセリフを付け加える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その奇抜な設定が面倒くさく、周囲から敬遠されがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と結婚すれば娘の面倒をみなくていいと喜んだ両親に、許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「くうぅ、右手の封印が……我から今すぐに離れよ……！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47530"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7c5d1788a3047750792a3d980f26b0e5f59bfe85f3ac47b55c521884c8e83e7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e449bdb94a4ffdb98ea2bf9ce6ff77bad0277a41a25d0b5e661122c6eec924b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47530:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34111","characterName":"ペッパー・ザラ・クーポン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47531","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6250"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34111"},"originalCharacterName":"ペッパー・ザラ・クーポン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The princess of a foreign counry who lacks common sense but is very gentle. In order to become a bride, she decided to become one of the wife candidates herself. In fact, Pepper is always carrying around the marriage forms with her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34111"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"常識知らずではあるが、穏やかな性格である国のお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を一目で気に入り、嫁になるために許嫁クラスに入った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に婚姻届けを持っており、隙あらばサインを書かせようとする茶目っ気もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"超絶な権力を持っているが、それを利用して主人公を籠絡しようとは考えておらず等身大の自分で勝負したいと思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6250","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"常識知らずではあるが、穏やかな性格である一国のお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を一目で気に入り、嫁になるために許嫁クラスに入った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に婚姻届けを持っており、隙あらばサインを書かせようとする茶目っ気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身の持つ超絶な権力を利用しようとは考えず、等身大の自分で勝負したいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「初めまして。 わたくしが貴方様の妻となる者です」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47531"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d293cf16a602c0519695cd19a21d1116f1bde09332d9bdd136145d92aaef3ad2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c890311bcb9d0cde0eab27dd299d673c13bb781ef4cac4f49d3a156677121eaa.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47531:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34112","characterName":"籠守 やすみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47532","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6251"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34112"},"originalCharacterName":"籠守 やすみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who became a recluse after finding human relationships way too troublesome to maintain. She is also an acquaintance of Shinji in an online game, and is actually married to him in the game. She even calls herself his wife in real life. Yasumi became one of the wife candidates in order ensure that her \"husband\" wouldn't be cheating on her with other girls."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34112"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"現実世界の人間関係に疲れ、家に引き篭もっていた女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネトゲをプレイしていた際、主人公と知り合い、ゲーム内で結婚したが、現実でも本当に結婚した信じ、自称嫁を公言する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の為に許嫁クラスが作られることを知り、「浮気される」と思い込み、慌てて許嫁クラスに入ることした。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6251","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"現実世界の人間関係に疲れ、家に引き篭もっていた女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネトゲで主人公と知り合いゲーム内で結婚し、現実でも “主人公の嫁” を自称する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"許嫁クラスの存在を知り、“旦那の浮気” を防ぐため慌てて編入した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あ、ああ、ああああなたが私の、だ、だ、だん、だんな、旦那様、ですか……？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47532"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94860e32476ac62c172f2fa56719010213a8e033b06819e486a5193826b10853.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f54fd6ac6c6e0121a3265fbe1693b47d4ad04769951f09ff4bb06f36d2e088b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大咲茉菜","creatorId":"vndb:s27","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s27","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s27","name":"大咲 茉菜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47532:19137:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34113","characterName":"白銀 りこ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47533","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6252"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34113"},"originalCharacterName":"白銀 りこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who is popular in the academy due to owning psychic powers. She is convinced that the protagonist is hiding some kind of an evil power inside him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34113"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超能力者で学園の有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は竹をわったような性格で上級生、下級生問わず人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が特殊な人間と自覚しており、そのことに誇りを持っているが、誰からも「特別」と見なされる現状を寂しく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことを親の権力を使い、女性を集めた悪と思い込んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6252","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"超能力者で学園の有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竹を割ったような性格で、上級生・下級生問わず人気が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が特殊な人間と自覚しており、そのことに誇りを持っているが、誰からも “特別” と見なされる現状を寂しく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことを、親の権力を使って女性を集めた悪と思い込んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「好きこのんで “特別” に産まれたかったわけじゃないわよ……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47533"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3340968628f27f68ecd7114db4ffb6452b52cb3336b5a3db8abf3799b6a6412.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/9577ab08ceb6a72fe2c779605caa60636f0921a585cf877341a10e279430c571.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村麻未","creatorId":"vndb:s980","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s980","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s980","name":"中村 麻未","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47533:15637:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34114","characterName":"赤馬 速矢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47534","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6253"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34114"},"originalCharacterName":"赤馬 速矢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A super optimistic girl. She likes girls more, but doesn't particularly hate men. Haya has a tendency of hugging the guys she's interested in."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34114"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"活発で超ポジティブシンキング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どちらかと言うと女の方が少し好きだが、男も嫌いではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"興味がある男には積極的に抱きついたりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「絶対許可書」を持っているにも関わらず、使おうとしない主人公を気に入っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公以外は全員女の子という花園が気に入り、許嫁クラスにすすんで入った。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6253","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"活発で超ポジティブシンキング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どちらかと言うと女のほうが少し好きだが、男も嫌いではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"興味がある男には積極的に抱きついたりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公以外は全員女の子という花園が気に入り、許嫁クラスには望んで入った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“絶対許可証” を持っているにも関わらず使おうとしない主人公を気に入っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「別に女の子だけじゃなくて男も好きだよ？　つまりボクはバイ率ドンっ！ってわけさ♪」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47534"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1515649900e390e0b3a663ee449c7851dcc923af5ff9ebb6106389007f5b6194.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89443df470fad13914f281f70da00ead010ecd02ea9d74997780fc0f08b5a1d6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神保巴","creatorId":"vndb:s455","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s455","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s455","name":"神保 巴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47534:12718:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34115","characterName":"千羽 ゆかりこ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47535","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6254"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34115"},"originalCharacterName":"千羽 ゆかりこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A honor student and the class president. She has no confidence in herself due to her step mother repeatedly telling her she has no value. In order to become a millionaire, Yukariko's mother decided to make her one of the wife candidates."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34115"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀でしっかり者で優しい優等生の委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"継母から「お前には価値がない」と言われた続けた為、自分に自信をもてないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゆかりこと主人公が結婚すれば、大金持ちになれると思った継母に許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は価値のない自分に興味など持つはずがないと思い、安心している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6254","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀なしっかり者で、優しい委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"継母から 「お前には価値がない」 と言われ続けたため、自分に自信が持てずにいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と結婚させれば大金持ちになれると思った継母に、許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし価値のない自分に主人公が興味を持つはずがないと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「そんな期待しないで？　私はなんでも知っているように見えるだけだから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47535"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea0213592cf6f2d8432ee3963ab8accbc58ec183eee545060b53e19d574c449e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d98b5da3aa6f588e16d6bd826eafc9d24a6be27740217aa55851dae59d9c8022.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47535:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34116","characterName":"鉄虎 鈴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47536","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6255"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34116"},"originalCharacterName":"鉄虎 鈴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who is always alone due to always carrying her bokken around her. Her parents decided to make her one of the wife candidates in order to calm her down and stop causing trouble in order to punish people."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34116"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小柄だが手がつけられない暴れ虎。何かあると木刀で暴れる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲から怖がられており、いつも一人でいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性を囲う主人公を警戒している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"問題を起こしてばかりいるため、彼女が男嫌いなことを逆手に取り、お仕置きの意味も兼ねて、両親が許嫁クラスに入れられた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6255","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小柄だが、手がつけられない暴れ虎。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かあると木刀を持って暴れるため周囲から怖がられており、いつも一人でいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"問題を起こしてばかりなのでお仕置きの意味も兼ねて、両親に許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男嫌いであり、女性を囲う主人公を警戒している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「邪魔だ。どけ、ヘンタイ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47536"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/346a3ec3211bf172fc44a1e920d05981a2327ba7b6889e2395ae227c37bdab58.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a0e3e40c2e0d6a229e5dd9add3f07aebbfce197c3f88dce0ee62d818cb2437a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"あさみほとり","creatorId":"vndb:s902","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s902","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s902","name":"あさみ ほとり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47536:11646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34117","characterName":"比留川 光","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47537","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6256"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34117"},"originalCharacterName":"比留川 光","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who is the current No. 1 School Idol. At first she was just recruited to become an idol, but fastly rose up in the rankings. A girl who is always smiling and has exquisite communication skills. She rarely puts effort in anything except her idol activites, and it's also unknown just how Hikaru was able to get into the \"wife candidate\" class."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34117"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんとなく誘われてやってみたスクールアイドルにはまった女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもニコニコ現役ナンバーワン学生アイドル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気溌剌で、コミュニケーション能力が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドジで間抜けなところもあるが、アイドル活動にかける情熱は本物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"許嫁クラスに入ったのは、なんとなく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6256","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"スクールアイドルとして活動している女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誘われてなんとなく始めたのだが、今や現役No.1学生アイドル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもニコニコ元気溌剌で、コミュニケーション能力が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドジで間抜けなところもあるが、アイドル活動にかける情熱は本物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"許嫁クラスに入ったのは、なんとなく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ライブでファンの人たちに見られてると、なんか身体が熱くなっちゃうんだよねぇ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47537"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5962e7c4de21d52803f31bc40e4ba956e849dbee91aef8ce70ee9b965e25790.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd6493440033f39b10e9f8ab111c40b455966850ee6c3679e6349277ce5b8d73.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47537:6480:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34118","characterName":"松盾 綾花","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47538","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6257"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34118"},"originalCharacterName":"松盾 綾花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who is always seen with a lab coat. She likes taking care of people and examining their injuries. Ayaka has a carefree personality and often unconsciously flirts with the guys around her, which creates misunderstandings. Though she is not aware of it, Ayaka became one of the wife candidates because the principal wanted someone to take care of Shinji if he gets injured or something along the lines."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34118"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段から白衣を羽織り生活しており、人を癒やすことに至福を覚える女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"呑気な性格だが、無意識に誘惑行動をしており、よく男性に勘違いされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長に治療の腕を見込まれ、主人公に何かあったときのために迅速に対応できるよう、許嫁クラスに入れられたが、本人はそのことを知らない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6257","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段から白衣を羽織って生活している女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ケガを診るのが好きで、人を癒やすことに生き甲斐を感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"呑気な性格で、男性に対して無意識に誘惑行動をしてしまい、よく勘違いされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長に治療の腕を見込まれ、主人公に何かあったとき迅速に対応できるよう許嫁クラスに入れられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし本人はそのことを知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お怪我をしたら、ぜひぜひ私を頼ってくださいね～」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47538"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16cfa726e3afc4c57a7809f0e27aaf17c3a1d8fa8d2f4ff50d9784167463fbe8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7df54f1528d3c440074414cf2a9c2851b2bf64ee4b95e5b4f384f9c8901f7e50.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今谷皆美","creatorId":"vndb:s648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s648","name":"今谷 皆美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:126232:47538:15684:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c34119","characterName":"雪弓 こはる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"47539","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"126232"}],"egsCharacterIds":["6258"],"vndbCharacterId":"c34119"},"originalCharacterName":"雪弓 こはる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Madonna-like entity in the school due to her good looks and excelling in anything she does. Has a large fanbase of both boys and girls. She has a serious and refined personality, but for some reason, called Shinji \"onii-sama\" during their first meeting... Koharu became one of the wife candidates by her own will after the principal showed her a picture of Shinji, and is ready to eliminate anyone who harms or makes fun of him with all she's got."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34119"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀でスポーツ万能。さらに容姿端麗でもある女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園のマドンナ的存在であり、男女問わず多くのファンがいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目でお淑やかだが、初対面時から主人公を「お兄様」と呼ぶ変な子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長に主人公の写真を見せられ、自ら許嫁クラスに入った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に危害を加える者、馬鹿にする者に対しては、全力をもって排除しようとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6258","sourceWorkId":"21552","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀でスポーツ万能、そのうえ容姿端麗な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園のマドンナ的存在であり、男女問わず多くのファンがいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まじめでお淑やかだが、初対面時から主人公を “お兄様” と呼ぶ変な子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長に主人公の写真を見せられ、自ら許嫁クラスに入った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に危害を加える者、馬鹿にする者を、全力で排除しようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お兄様、一緒に帰りませんか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"47539"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/116d28178505b06cf9398f11caf3f3aa9c4db9ea9d6714aa882ce31737984f14.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/114c63a0d7663b182fd20bfabe0897ccc1e8b9593ccedde10d7fece866d1ed9f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEn